OL,5,G1100 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FOn payment day, allegations of
OL,7,     Ffoul play after one pair gave
OL,8,     Fconsistently low scores throughout
OL,9,     Fthe week get the blood boiling,
OL,10,     Fbefore the winners are revealed.
OL,11,G1130 Four in a Bed
OL,12,     FThe competition starts at Chimneys
OL,13,     FB&B in Suffolk, where Carolyn
OL,14,     Fhopes that her guests will like
OL,15,     Fher uptempo personality. But
OL,16,     FAndrea and John aren't keen on
OL,17,     Fbeing in self-catering.
